    "summary": "Shield-shaped panel (&#039;Uut Kap Ilgitsh&#039;); made of wool, cotton, silk and metal thread, with glass beads. Embroidery and tassels, with ikat-dyed area around edges only. Red background, with central pear-shaped motif in yellow bordered with purple scrolled edging. At top corners are multi-coloured squares with internal design; at bottom corners are multi-coloured pear-shaped motifs with tall green pairs of scrolls emerging from top. Towards shield point is diamond motif, edging with repeating pairs of scrolls.",
